<title>UK: Nordbanken sets 450 mln Skr FRN.</title>
<headline>Nordbanken sets 450 mln Skr FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDBANKEN</p>
<p> AMT    450 MLN SKR   BASE	 3M-STIBOR MATURITY    21.JUN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE   L15.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A1/A	ISS PRICE  100.10    FULL FEES   10 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME. L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
